           *> QUOTE-APPROVE (link): the customer decides with the quote number and the short code; the code works only once.
           *> Uses:   QAP-MODE = "L"; QAP-QUO-ID = TXT-CQUO; QAP-CODE = TXT-CODE; QAP-DECISION = A or R; QAP-REASON = TXT-REASON.
           *> Result: QAS-STATUS = OK, BADCODE, USED, EXPIRED or INVALID; with OK the quote becomes APROVADO or RECUSADO.
           CALL    "QUOTE-APPROVE" WITH WEBSOCKET LINKAGE
               USING BY VALUE QAP-REQ
               RETURNING QAP-RES
               ON EXCEPTION
                   COBOL::"WS-LAST-ERROR" ( BE-CLASS BE-CODE BE-MSG )
                   SET     QAS-STATUS            TO    "CALL"
           END-CALL

           IF    QAS-STATUS = "CALL"
