           *> QUOTE-APPROVE (manual): the consultant registers the decision the customer gave by phone, WhatsApp or at the counter.
           *> Uses:   QAP-MODE = "M"; QAP-QUO-ID = TXT-QUO; QAP-DECISION = A or R; QAP-CHANNEL = the chosen radio; QAP-OPERATOR = TXT-OPERATOR.
